== Overview ==
The '''Triple Flying Jetpack Toilet''' is a strong [[Enemies|enemy]] added in the [[Episode 51 Update]]. It only appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and [[Endless Mode]].
== Appearance: ==
The Triple Flying Jetpack Toilet has three heads attached to a bathtub. It has 5 rockets and a jetpack. The individual heads use different faces and skin tones.
